#: ../../source/janim/timeline/misc.rst:2
msgid "misc"
msgstr "misc"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin:1 of
msgid "对 :class:`~.AudioMixin` 与 :class:`~.SubtitlesMixin` 的整合， 给 :class:`~.Timeline` 提供了一些额外的功能"
msgstr ""
"Integrates :class:`~.AudioMixin` and :class:`~.SubtitlesMixin`, providing additional functionality for :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin:5 of
msgid "该类中的方法都可以直接在 :class:`~.Timeline` 中使用"
msgstr "All methods in this class can be used directly in :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.aas:1 of
msgid ":meth:`audio_and_subtitle` 的简写"
msgstr "Short form of :meth:`audio_and_subtitle`"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:1 of
msgid "播放音频，并在播放期间显示字幕"
msgstr "Plays audio and displays subtitles during playback"

#: ../../source/janim/timeline/misc.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:3 of
msgid "音频文件路径"
msgstr "Path to the audio file"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:5 of
msgid "在音频播放期间显示的字幕"
msgstr "Subtitles displayed during audio playback"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:7 of
msgid ""
"音频的裁剪区间  默认为 ``clip=...`` （省略号）表示自动确定裁剪区间，将前后的空白去除  可设置为 ``clip=None`` 来禁用自动裁"
"剪，保留音频全长  也可以设置 ``(begin, end)`` 手动设置裁剪区间"
msgstr ""
"The clipping interval of the audio.  Defaults to ``clip=...`` (ellipsis), which means the clipping interval is determined "
"automatically by removing leading and trailing silence.  Set ``clip=None`` to disable automatic clipping and keep the "
"full audio length. You can also set ``(begin, end)`` to manually specify the clipping interval"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:7 of
msgid "音频的裁剪区间"
msgstr "The clipping interval of the audio"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:9 of
msgid "默认为 ``clip=...`` （省略号）表示自动确定裁剪区间，将前后的空白去除"
msgstr ""
"Defaults to ``clip=...`` (ellipsis), which means the clipping interval is determined automatically by removing leading "
"and trailing silence"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:11 of
msgid "可设置为 ``clip=None`` 来禁用自动裁剪，保留音频全长"
msgstr "Can be set to ``clip=None`` to disable automatic clipping and keep the full audio length"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:13 of
msgid "也可以设置 ``(begin, end)`` 手动设置裁剪区间"
msgstr "Can also be set to ``(begin, end)`` to manually specify the clipping interval"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:15 of
msgid "音量的缩放倍率"
msgstr "Volume scaling factor"

#: janim.timeline.misc.AudiosAndSubtitlesMixin.audio_and_subtitle:17 of
msgid "传递给 :meth:`~.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle` 的参数"
msgstr "Parameters passed to :meth:`~.SubtitlesMixin.subtitle`"

#: janim.timeline.misc.DebugMixin:1 of
msgid "向 :class:`~.Timeline` 提供一些调试功能"
msgstr "Provides some debugging functionality for :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.misc.DebugMixin.debug:1 of
msgid "将物件的动画栈显示在时间轴中"
msgstr "Display the item's animation stack in the timeline"

#: janim.timeline.misc.DebugMixin.debug:5 of
msgid "显示在时间轴中的一个黄色扁条表示在哪些区段中物件是可见的"
msgstr "A yellow bar displayed in the timeline indicates in which ranges the item is visible"
